  "implemented": [
    "Replace the oversized solar disc with an actual .00465rad angular core and world atmospheric aureole. Finer finite cloud density has golden illumination/blue self shadow. Cooler sky PMREM/hemisphere and reduced warm auxiliary sources recover blue ceramic and less black shadow response. Original exposure, physical reference camera and dolly remain; no frame filter/background photograph/false beam.",
    "Wet varnish uses a genuine full-projection virtual-camera capture on the actual closed board meshes with Fresnel/coverage mixture. Its proxy is never added to or drawn in the world. Shared-index board top/back now sample <=14mm cross-width as well as <=60mm length, so the1.35mm cup, long bow and submillimetre grain relief are actual surfaces with derivative normals, not a normal above a flat span.",
    "Four bridge bents replace the five-row exposed forest. Eight real jointed stone piers retain fitted cap/girder/joist contact; outer pairs integrate into graded closed bank volumes with embedded eroded rock and original rooted low growth.",
    "Recover one pond levelY1.0 under the unchanged reference camera. Inner pier-foot projection moves from aroundy842/845 to aroundy788/790; exposed pier height decreases about1m. Pond interface/reflection, floating lotus and wet material zone use one level. Real western landing rises toY1.25 with three actual connected risers; upper bridge deck/camera remain held.",
    "Closed stair/rear/east/near bank toes retie toY.88 below water while upper terrace crests remain. Submerged ordinary roots are omitted, actual bank plants follow evaluated soil, and crown clearance excludes the real veranda footprint. Framing tree roots gain a real raised island seat, small island tree upper targets remain, and the near stone lantern rises.25m onto an explicit bed-embedded submerged footing.",
    "Four metric millimetre/submillimetre water-height derivatives supply actual optical normals, dielectricF0.0204 Schlick reflectance and genuine reflected-scene highlight breakup. Dark nonmetal water underlay replaces the broad brown mirror response. Three compact foreground floating-pad beds occupy recovered pond positions while preserving the central lane."
  ],
